Relationship:
For each ResolutionAction there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of &#x27;resolved’ on the from and an OutOfSpecAction class or subclass on the to.&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
# https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/plannedStorageLocation node9
